@ngxson The fix is just in `tools/mtmd/mtmd-helper.cpp`:

1. Write the video file to a seekable stream ffmpeg can reference (e.g. a temporary file). There might be in-memory ways of doing this that might be better. You can do this in `mtmd_helper_video_init_from_buf`.
2. Replace `ctx->input_buf.assign(buf, buf + len);` with `ctx->path = <temp file path>;` in `tools/mtmd/mtmd-helper.cpp`.
3. Make sure to clean up the file when it's done, for example something like

