There are several options on non-Windows platforms. I am not a Windows user but I didn't find any way to do it in memory on Windows from a quick search. I think for other platforms we should support the in-memory option, but on Windows that detection seems like a best effort attempt. If we really wanted it in memory on Windows we would have to embed some of the ffmpeg libraries.

