query:
Dragging a dock when all tabs on Main Screen are closed causes errors to appear

### Tested versions

- Reproducible on 4.8 dev5 and 4.8 beta 1

### System information

Godot v4.8.dev5 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor (1920x1200 @ 165.00 Hz) - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7260) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700H (20 threads) - 15.79 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)

### Issue description

Starting to drag a tab on a DockTabContainer will give errors if the main screen dock container is empty, 

> 
>   ERROR: scene/gui/tab_bar.cpp:2158 - Index p_tab = 0 is out of bounds (tabs.size() = 0).
>   ERROR: scene/gui/tab_bar.cpp:2158 - Index p_tab = -1 is out of bounds (tabs.size() = 0).
> 

<details><summary> State Image </summary>
<img width="1909" height="1112" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/243001f1-1be2-4ab8-841c-77aa18c2f628" />
</details>

This happens because on this iteration in `EditorDockManager::_get_dock_tab_dragged()`:

```cpp
for (int i = 0; i < EditorDock::DOCK_SLOT_MAX; i++) {
	dock_slots[i]->show_drag_hint();
}
```

When the dock slot is EditorMainScreen it calls `get_drag_hint_rect()` on it, but for this case there this override which doesn't account that doesn't deal with being called on an empty tab:, as it calls `get_tab_rect(0)` and `get_tab_rect(-1)`

```cpp
Rect2 EditorMainScreen::get_drag_hint_rect() const {
	const Rect2 tab_rect = get_internal_container()->get_global_rect();
	const Rect2 content_rect = get_global_rect();
	Rect2 final_rect = tab_rect.merge(content_rect);
	float tab_x = get_tab_bar()->get_global_transform().xform(get_tab_bar()->get_tab_rect(0).position).x;
	final_rect.position.x = MIN(tab_x, content_rect.position.x);
	tab_x = get_tab_bar()->get_global_transform().xform(get_tab_bar()->get_tab_rect(-1).get_end()).x;
	final_rect.set_end(Vector2(MAX(tab_x, content_rect.get_end().x), final_rect.get_end().y));
	return final_rect;
}
```

### Steps to reproduce

- Close all the tabs Main Screen (2D, 3D, ...)
- Drag a tab that is in another slot and check output

### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)

N/A

